# Runs before every `git commit`. If any step fails, the commit is stopped,
# so broken or unformatted code never gets saved (or pushed to Vercel).
# 1. Format + lint only the files being committed (see .lintstagedrc.json)
npx lint-staged
# 2. Type-check the whole project
npm run typecheck
# 3. Run every unit test once
npm test
